{"channelId":"UCCo7wrafhB_o4GFeUTScwGg","row":["Align Wellness Center, Northbrook IL",66800,"We are a Chiropractic Care and Wellness Center located in Northbrook, IL, dedicated to helping you live a pain-free life without relying on drugs or surgery. Our clinic is home to three experienced corrective care specialists: Dr. Gregg Gerstin (23+ yrs experience), Dr. Luke, and Dr. Britney.\n\nWe help active adults, desk workers, athletes, and families across Chicago’s North Shore find lasting solutions.\n\n🔍 Common Conditions We Treat:\nSciatica & Pinched Nerves\nLower Back Pain & Stiff Joints\nNeck Pain & Tension Headaches\nHerniated & Bulging Discs\nArthritis & Joint Pain\nForward Head Posture & \"Tech Neck\"\nScoliosis & Spinal Misalignments\n\nUnlike typical chiropractors who focus on quick pop-and-crack fixes, we prioritize true structural correction. We target the root cause of your pain to promote natural healing and deliver long-term relief so you can stay active for life.\n\n📍 666 Dundee Rd 401, Northbrook, IL 60062\n📞 (847) 564-9500 | 🌐 alignwc.com","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCo7wrafhB_o4GFeUTScwGg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCo7wrafhB_o4GFeUTScwGg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:39.480Z","channelId":"UCCo7wrafhB_o4GFeUTScwGg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"5d532b75f83a096f135e8ab28366a76889b4384ae513c30fb63b7ee0a94c2321","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"2e6f88cc05ca39dcb921dc18f528b7ffb7c09e14ece42b8254992a6ab8e22338"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCo7wrafhB_o4GFeUTScwGg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:39.480Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCo7wrafhB_o4GFeUTScwGg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":66800,"raw":"66.8K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCo7wrafhB_o4GFeUTScwGg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:39.480Z"}]